.TH "ELEMENT.GETATTRIBUTENS" "3JS" "August 19, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
Element.getAttributeNS \- Element: getAttributeNS() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]getAttributeNS()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]Element\f[R] interface returns the string value of the specified
namespaced attribute of the specified element.
It returns \f[CR]null\f[R] if the element doesn\(cqt have an attribute
with the given name in the namespace.
.PP
If you are working with HTML documents and you don\(cqt need to specify
the requested attribute as being part of a specific namespace, use the
\f[CR]getAttribute()\f[R] method instead.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
getAttributeNS(namespace, localName)
.EE
.SS Parameters
.TP
\f[B]namespace\f[R]
A string specifying the namespace of the attribute, or \f[CR]null\f[R]
for no explicit namespace.
.TP
\f[B]localName\f[R]
A string specifying the name of the attribute.
.SS Return value
A string containing the attribute\(cqs value, or \f[CR]null\f[R] if the
element doesn\(cqt have an attribute with the given name.
.SH EXAMPLES
The following SVG document reads the value of the \f[CR]foo\f[R]
attribute in a custom namespace.
.IP
.EX
<\f[B]svg\f[R] xmlns=\(dqhttp://www.w3.org/2000/svg\(dq
    xmlns:test=\(dqhttp://www.example.com/2014/test\(dq width=\(dq40\(dq height=\(dq40\(dq>

  <\f[B]circle\f[R] id=\(dqtarget\(dq cx=\(dq12\(dq cy=\(dq12\(dq r=\(dq10\(dq stroke=\(dq#444444\(dq
      stroke\-width=\(dq2\(dq fill=\(dqnone\(dq test:foo=\(dqHello namespaced attribute!\(dq/>

  <\f[B]script\f[R]>
    const ns = \(aqhttp://www.example.com/2014/test\(aq;
    const circle = document.getElementById(\(aqtarget\(aq);

    console.log(\(gaattribute test:foo: \(dq${circle.getAttributeNS(ns, \(aqfoo\(aq)}\(dq\(ga);
  </\f[B]script\f[R]>
</\f[B]svg\f[R]>
.EE
.PP
In an HTML document, the attribute has to be accessed with
\f[CR]test:foo\f[R] since namespaces are not supported.
.IP
.EX
<\f[B]svg\f[R]
  xmlns=\(dqhttp://www.w3.org/2000/svg\(dq
  xmlns:test=\(dqhttp://www.example.com/2014/test\(dq
  width=\(dq40\(dq
  height=\(dq40\(dq>
  <\f[B]circle\f[R]
    id=\(dqtarget\(dq
    cx=\(dq12\(dq
    cy=\(dq12\(dq
    r=\(dq10\(dq
    stroke=\(dq#444444\(dq
    stroke\-width=\(dq2\(dq
    fill=\(dqnone\(dq
    test:foo=\(dqFoo value\(dq />
</\f[B]svg\f[R]>
.EE
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] ns = \(dqhttp://www.example.com/2014/test\(dq;
\f[B]const\f[R] circle = document.getElementById(\(dqtarget\(dq);
console.log(\(gaAttribute value: ${circle.getAttribute(\(dqtest:foo\(dq)}\(ga);
.EE
